      "message": "[Gerrit AI Review] ❌ **Changes requested** — See inline comments for details. [[trajectory](https://goto.corp.google.com/traj/08b4a7f6-2d04-4ef8-9c2d-020d368148aa)]\n\n**Review Summary**\n*   **Functionality \u0026 Policy:** The CL removes the `METADATA` file to reduce Linux CVE noise, but replacing it with `README.md` breaks integration with automated license compliance and security vulnerability tracking tools.\n*   **Security:** Bypassing CVE tracking by removing the `METADATA` file means any future vulnerabilities in this specific header might not be automatically flagged.\n*   **Style:** The `README.md` is readable and captures the source information well.\n*   **Testing \u0026 Test Coverage:** N/A (Documentation/Metadata change only).\n*   **CL Size \u0026 Scope:** **XS** (Size is small and well-scoped to this specific change).",
